{
  "Scenes.Ghoul.Defeated.ScreechVanishes": "The ghoul lets out a furious screech as your attacks become too much to bear, and vanishes in a dusty cloud of sand. You're left staring at the spot, wondering if you just hallucinated everything that happened."
  "Scenes.Ghoul.GhoulBlind.BlindedStatus": "<b>You are blinded!</b>"
  "Scenes.Ghoul.GhoulBlind.BlindingFlash": "The ghoul glares and points at you! A bright flash erupts before you! "
  "Scenes.Ghoul.GhoulBlind.BlinkInTime": "You manage to blink in the nick of time!"
  "Scenes.Ghoul.GhoulMagic.AlchemicCircle": "The ghoul chants out an incantation, and a dark alchemic circle forms around your feet. "
  "Scenes.Ghoul.GhoulMagic.CircleDodged": "You jump out of the circle before anything happens. Where you'd just been erupts in flames."
  "Scenes.Ghoul.GhoulMagic.FlamesScorch": "Blackened flames burst from the circle, causing you to seize with pain as they scorch every inch of your body."
  "Scenes.Ghoul.HyenaBite.BiteDodged": "The hyena lunges for you, aiming to bite you, but easily move out of the way."
  "Scenes.Ghoul.HyenaBite.BlindBiteMiss": "The hyena lunges for you, aiming to bite you, but misses entirely due to its blindness!"
  "Scenes.Ghoul.HyenaBite.TeethSink": "The hyena lunges for you, sinking its teeth into you."
  "Scenes.Ghoul.HyenaClaw.BlindClawMiss": "The hyena slashes its paw at you, but misses due to its blindness!"
  "Scenes.Ghoul.HyenaClaw.ClawDodged": "The hyena slashes its paw at you, but you easily move out of the way."
  "Scenes.Ghoul.HyenaClaw.ClawRakes": "The hyena slashes its paw at you, raking down hard and causing you to yelp in pain."
  "Scenes.Ghoul.React.IllusionDispelled": "Your [weapon] strikes the hyena, causing it to recoil and vanish in a cloud of sandy dust. You stumble back in surprise and look up to see a snarling, ghostly creature in the air. Your enemy wasn't a hyena. <b>It was a ghoul!</b>[pg]"
  "Scenes.Ghoul.React.IllusionWoreOff": "<b>The wild Ghoul's illusion wore off!</b>[pg]"
  "Scenes.Ghoul.WhenAttacked.IllusionDispelled": "Your [weapon] strikes the hyena, causing it to recoil and vanish in a cloud of sandy dust. You stumble back in surprise and look up to see a snarling, ghostly creature in the air. Your enemy wasn't a hyena. <b>It was a ghoul!</b>[pg]"
  "Scenes.Ghoul.WhenAttacked.IllusionWoreOff": "<b>The wild Ghoul's illusion wore off!</b>[pg]"
  "Scenes.Ghoul.Won.DisgustedVanishes": "\nThe ghoul lets out a disgusted noise and vanishes without a word."
}
